      "writtenOn": "2023-02-21T16:29:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have followed the order as follows\n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2420224\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2420225\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2420226\n\nBut middle change lead to conflict, please help on this resolution\n\nandroid13-5.15-2023-01:\n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2447548 --\u003e clean\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2447802 --\u003e conflict, need to resolve it.\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2447803 --\u003e clean",
      "parentUuid": "942bbc61_41397d31",
      "revId": "b05008b2550afafa6f29bc80799678185507d995",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
